{"kind": "mod", "id": 2304, "name": "Dragon Den - Neon Signs", "slug": "dragon-den-neon-signs", "teaser": "15 custom neon signs to brighten up Tarkov. They glow, they stand out, and you can use them just like posters.", "owner_name": "Drexira", "downloads": 7348, "favourites": 13, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "net.drexira.neonsigns", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Hideout", "category_id": 6, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T06:16:25.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-09-11T20:51:04.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-09-11T20:51:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "2.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Features</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>15 new neon sign items</li>\n<li>Glows properly in dark spots</li>\n<li>Spawns in raid where posters normally spawn</li>\n<li>Can be placed in hideout poster slots</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Usage</strong></p>\n<p>They work like posters… you’ll find them in raid at poster spawn points, and you can stick them in hideout poster slots.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Image Galore</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Baby%20Appa%20Ingame.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Baby Appa Ingame\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Baby%20Appa.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Baby Appa\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:/